      "rationale": "Blitzcrank is overperforming, especially in KR (53.1% WR, 27.7% ban rate). His power comes from how often he can threaten a hook, both in lane and in later fights. Raising Rocket Grab's cooldown by 1 second at every rank (20-16 \u2192 21-17) gives opponents a slightly longer window after each missed or landed hook. That lowers his lane pressure and how often he can pick people off, while leaving his damage and the feel of his kit the same. Sim: soloq_index -1.63%, pro_index -0.63%. Both are inside their target bands with room to spare."
